{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "ZFS-Replikation (pvesr) zwischen den PVE-Hosts. Quelle: Textfile-Collector pvesr-metrics.py (ansible/pve-replication-monitoring.yml) ueber den Job pve-node-exporter. postgres-prod (4600), Home Assistant (100) und Frigate (4502) haengen fuer PVE-HA an diesen Replikaten — ein Rueckstand hier ist verlorenes RPO im Failover-Fall. Fehlertexte stehen in Loki: {host=~\"pve0[123]\"} |= \"replication\".",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Proxmox Hypervisoren",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/pve-hosts"
    }
  ],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "description": "Replikationsjobs mit fail_count > 0. PVE wiederholt mit Backoff (5/10/15/30min) und mailt beim ersten Fehlschlag. Ein einzelner Fehler waehrend der naechtlichen Wartung heilt sich selbst; der Alert pvesr-job-failing feuert erst ab 3 Fehlversuchen in Folge.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
          "expr": "count(pvesr_job_fail_count > 0) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Jobs im Fehler",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "description": "Groesster Sync-Rueckstand aller aktiven Jobs, gemessen in Vielfachen des jeweiligen Job-Intervalls (*/1 wie */15 vergleichbar). Normal: um 1 (ein Job steht immer irgendwo in seinem Intervall). Deaktivierte Jobs zaehlen nicht. Alert pvesr-job-stale ab 10.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 5, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
          "expr": "max((time() - pvesr_job_last_sync_timestamp_seconds) / pvesr_job_schedule_seconds * (1 - pvesr_job_disabled))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Max. Sync-Rückstand (Zyklen)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "description": "Alter des Wartungs-Markers /etc/pve/.pvesr-maint-paused-*.json. Die Rolle proxmox_maintenance pausiert Jobs gegen den rebootenden Node und setzt diesen Marker; pvesr_resume entfernt ihn. Ein Marker aelter als 2h heisst: die Wartung hat die Jobs nicht reaktiviert (Alert pvesr-maintenance-pause-leaked).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": { "0": { "index": 0, "text": "keine" } },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 7200 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
